title: "Slate"
abstract: "A desktop prompt studio for AI filmmaking: plan shots scene by scene, keep characters, locations, and look consistent, direct coverage and music and voices with a local AI brain, and compile production-ready prompts for any image, video, music, or voice generator (Seedance, Kling, Veo, Midjourney, Flux, Suno, ElevenLabs, and more)."
